        "created_at": "2024-06-13T16:13:54.761Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, agreed.</p>\n<p>Jubilee (Marvel) has a similar <strong>backstory</strong>, in that she was living and hiding out at a mall after losing her parents, but – in her first comic appearance – after some of the X-Men saved her from an attack, she followed them and never went back. So we didn’t get her actual time at the mall, just the end of it. That might be as close as is out there. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\"></p>",
